  "text": "$189 New Patient Dental Special | Comprehensive Exam & Cleaning\n$189 New Patient Special\n\nYour journey to a healthier, happier you begins here.\n\nSCHEDULE TODAY\n Excellent ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Based on 1,700+ reviews\nVoted Neighborhood Favorite\n\nThank you to our amazing community for voting us a Neighborhood Favorite. Being trusted by our neighbors is the greatest honor and we are proud to serve you every day.\n\nBook Online\nNew Patient Special!\n\nStarting at\n\n$189\n\nGet\n\nComprehensive exam\n\nX-Rays\n\nCleaning\n\nFull Treatment Plan\n\n(Cannot be combined with insurance, new patients only, not valid in cases of periodiontal disease.)\n\nBook Online\nDR. WILLIAM SUNG DMD\n\nDr. William Sung comes from a family of dentists, which inspired his career. He is passionate about helping patients by improving their oral health and confidence. He is committed to continuous learning and providing high quality care.\n\n Dental Degree from Tufts University, Boston\n 10+ Years of Dental Experience\n Fellowship in Academy of General Dentistry (Top 7% in Texas)\n 100+ Hours of Continuing Education Every Year\nTESTIMONIALS\nWhat others are saying\n\n\"Testimonial lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Autem dolore, alias, numquam enim dolor elit.\"\n\nZara\n\n\"Testimonial lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Autem dolore, alias, numquam enim dolor elit.\"\n\nAshwin\n\n\"Testimonial lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Autem dolore, alias, numquam enim dolor elit.\"\n\nKaden\n\n\"Testimonial lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Autem dolore, alias, numquam enim dolor elit.\"\n\nElsie\n\nInsurance\n\nWe accept and honor most dental insurance plans. The following are just a few of the dental insurance carriers we're providers for:\n\nAETNA\nAMERITAS\nANTHEM BLUE CROSS\nCIGNA\nDELTA\nGUARDIAN\nMETLIFE\nUNITED HEALTH CARE\nUCCI\nOur Dental Services\n\nComprehensive care in every service. Your dental and overall wellness is our priority, and we look forward to serving you with the highest quality of care.\n\nEMERGENCY SERVICES\nCROWNS\nFILLINGS\nTEETH CLEANING\nPERIODONTICS\nROOT CANAL/ENDODONTICS\nVENEERS\nWHITENING\nWISDOM TEETH SURGERY\nINVISALIGN\nDENTAL IMPLANT\nALL ON X\nGET STARTED\nYour Smile is Our Priority\n\nSchedule an appointment with us today to discover the difference of advanced, proven technologies, a full suite of services, and exceptional quality in dental care – all tailored to give you a healthier, happier smile.\n\nSCHEDULE TODAY\nOffer Terms & Conditions\n\nRegular value of at least $290. In absence of gum (periodontal) disease. New patients only. Cannot be combined with any other offers. Limit 1 per patient. May be covered by insurance, subject to insurance restrictions; cannot be applied to insurance co-payments or deductible. Not valid for Tricare or Medicare Advantage members. AZ, CO, ID, and NM Delta Dental members: valid toward cosmetic dentistry only. Not valid for appointments with pediatric dentist.\n\nADDITIONAL SERVICES MAY BE REQUIRED AT AN ADDITIONAL FEE.\n\nValid only when appointment is booked prior to 08/31/2026. No cash or credit value. The patient and any other person responsible for payment has the right to refuse to pay, cancel payment, or be reimbursed for payment for any other service, examination or treatment that is performed as a result of and within 72 hours of responding to the advertisement for the fee, discounted fee or reduced fee service, examination or treatment. May be covered by insurance. Subject to plan restrictions. Services rendered by a General Practitioner.\n\nOFFICE HOURS\n\nMon: 9:00 am – 7:00 pm\nTue-Wed: 10:00 am – 8:00 pm\n\nThu-Fri: 8:00 am – 6:00 pm\nSat: 8:00 am – 3:00 pm\nSun: Closed\n\nCONTACT\n\n8620 Grand Mission Blvd Ste E, Richmond, TX 77407\n\nPhone: (281) 789-8836\n\nLOCATION\n\n🦷 New Patient Special: $189 Exam + X-rays + Cleaning"
